      "id": 1230,
      "__component": "macro-components.faqs",
      "description": null,
      "centered": true,
      "title": [
        {
          "id": 4643,
          "text": "Conditional logic FAQs",
          "highlight": false,
          "color": "#475467",
          "bold": false
        }
      ],
      "faqList": [
        {
          "id": 2278,
          "header": "What is a conditional logic form?",
          "body": "It's a form that changes based on the answers people give — showing, hiding, or skipping questions so each respondent sees only what's relevant to them.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2277,
          "header": "What can conditional logic do?",
          "body": "Show or hide fields, skip to other pages, reveal follow-up questions, and trigger conditional follow-ups like targeted emails or confirmation messages.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2279,
          "header": "Do I need to code it?",
          "body": "No. You pick the conditions and the fields to show or hide from drop-downs — no coding required.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2281,
          "header": "Does it work on surveys and payment forms?",
          "body": "Yes. It works across surveys, registration, application, and payment forms — including updating options or totals based on a choice.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2280,
          "header": "Do hidden fields still collect data?",
          "body": "No — only the fields a respondent actually sees are collected, which keeps your data clean and relevant.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2282,
          "header": "Is conditional logic available on the free plan?",
          "body": "Conditional logic is available on the Personal plan and up. Check the pricing page for details.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        }
      ]
    },
